sequenceDiagram
  participant owner as Application owner
  participant source as Source database
  participant recovery as Isolated recovery target
  participant app as Application
  owner->>source: Establish consistency point / freeze writes if required
  source->>recovery: Selected backup and WAL through object storage
  owner->>recovery: Validate target data, credentials, backups and health
  owner->>app: Planned endpoint switch and reconnect decision
  app->>recovery: New authoritative writes
  owner->>source: Retain isolated source for rollback window
  owner->>owner: Reconcile target writes before any rollback
